<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>GitOps Network Pipeline</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
    td { padding: .3rem .8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
    code { background: #f2f2f2; padding: .1rem .3rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>GitOps Network Pipeline</h1>
  <p>Servidor desplegado con <b>OpenTofu</b> y configurado con <b>Ansible</b> desde <b>GitHub Actions</b>.</p>
  <table>
    <tr><td>Host</td><td><code>{{ inventory_hostname }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>IP privada</td><td><code>{{ private_ip | default(ansible_default_ipv4.address) }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Commit</td><td><code>{{ git_sha }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Puertos abiertos</td><td><code>{{ firewall_allowed_ports | join(', ') }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Fecha despliegue</td><td><code>{{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}</code></td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
